  "Starting cards as posted: Watch Your Step, Heading For The Medical Frigate (deploying Menace Fades, Squadron Assignments and Your Insight Serves You Well), Tatooine: Cantina, Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 and Tatooine; all count toward the deck.",
  "Posted 'You Cannot Hide Forever (LS Equivalent)' dested Your Insight Serves You Well, the Light Death Star II counterpart of You Cannot Hide Forever (the Coruscant combo with Staging Areas was not out yet).",
  "Posted 'Tunnel Vision/Control' dested Control & Tunnel Vision; the strategy explains 3 combos plus 1 Dagobah Tunnel Vision.",
  "Posted 'Scout Luke' dested Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout; 'Beru & Owen' dested Owen Lars & Beru Lars; 'Lar's Farm' dested Tatooine: Lars' Moisture Farm; 'ECC Lando' dested Lando With Blaster Pistol; 'Jedi Luke' dested Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight.",
  "The 'Grabber' is not named, so it is printed as written.",
